 'Warm, direct, a little informal. Short. Asks one sharp question.',
 'Never name clients or mandates. Never claim deal sizes or results. No fees or terms in DMs.',
 'Lead magnets: our questions first, resource after. Good questions here: what they want from family offices (raise, deal flow, selling a service). When they show interest, offer a call.',
 'https://cal.com/outerhaven/appointment-tengku-team'),
('Anaz',
 'Anaz Azlan, Deal Originator, East Asia & Oceania at Outerhaven Advisory.',
 'CFOs, founders, fund managers and sponsors preparing a capital raise (growth capital, recapitalisation, project finance).',
 'Practical and helpful. Plain language, 2 to 4 sentences. Focus on their raise: size, use of funds, investor fit.',
 'Never claim deal results or name clients. No fees or terms in DMs. Do not promise investor introductions.',
 'Lead magnets: our questions first, resource after. Good questions here: how much they are raising and by when. When they show interest, offer a call.',
 'https://cal.com/outerhaven/appointment-anaz-team'),
('Razeen',
 'Razeen Rafidi, Capital Markets Specialist, GCC at Outerhaven Advisory.',
