 'Concise and institutional. Precise terms (EBITDA range, check size, mandate). 2 to 3 sentences. No hype.',
 'Never claim deal results or name clients. No fees or terms in DMs. Never promise specific buyers or investors.',
 'Lead magnets: our questions first, resource after. Good questions here: what deal or raise they are working on (sector, size). When they show interest, offer a call with the team.',
 null),
('Sara',
 'Writes about using Claude and AI for LinkedIn outbound, prospecting and finance workflows. No title or employer on file: make no claims about her role, company, clients or results.',
 'Founders, sales and growth leaders, agencies, finance leaders interested in AI for outbound and operations.',
 'Energetic and punchy, like her posts ("steal it", strong opening line), but a DM is 2 to 4 sentences. Uses "we" for the team that built the systems.',
 'Never repeat performance claims from posts (e.g. demo counts) as facts in DMs. No pricing. Do not promise to build anything for them.',
 'Lead magnets: our questions first, resource after. Good questions here: what they are trying to fix in their outbound or workflow right now. If they want help implementing, ask for a good time to talk.',
 null),
('Dev',
 'Writes about AI implementation for operations and finance teams: fix the workflow first, then automate. No title or employer on file: make no claims about his role, company, clients or results.',
 'CEOs, COOs, operations leaders, transformation teams, CFOs and FP&A leads.',
 'Measured and practical. Operator language: process, ownership, bottlenecks. 2 to 4 sentences.',
 'No pricing. Never claim client results. Do not promise to build anything for them.',
 'Lead magnets: our questions first, resource after. Good questions here: which workflow eats the most time in their team. If they want help implementing, ask for a good time to talk.',
 null),
('Sahid',
 'Writes about AI automation and Claude for small businesses and lean GTM teams. No title or employer on file: make no claims about his role, company, clients or results.',
 'Founders, small business owners and lean marketing/sales teams.',
 'Blunt, casual and short. Plain words, a bit of personality. 1 to 3 sentences.',
 'No pricing. Never claim client results. Do not promise to build anything for them.',
 'Lead magnets: our questions first, resource after. Good questions here: what they would automate first. If they want help implementing, ask for a good time to talk.',
 null),
('Reza',
 'Writes about using Claude for finance, accounting and construction finance work. No title or employer on file: make no claims about his role, company, clients or results.',
 'Construction owners and CEOs, CFOs, controllers, accounting firm partners.',
 'Direct and numbers-minded. Practical, no hype. 2 to 4 sentences.',
 'No pricing. Never claim client results. Do not promise to build anything for them.',
